{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.908,"lines":[{"text":"Hèèèè, Charles le Bon, l’homme qui a découvert l’embouchure de la musique.","t":3.56,"e":8.22,"w":[["Hèèèè",3.56,3.76],["Charles",3.86,4.22],["le",4.25,4.45],["Bon",4.28,4.48],["l’homme",5.88,6.08],["qui",6.14,6.22],["a",6.24,6.28],["découvert",6.32,6.8],["l’embouchure",6.84,7.44],["de",7.48,7.54],["la",7.6,7.66],["musique",7.72,8.22]],"ok":0.83},{"text":"Yeah… Elengi ya bolingo, ékómi mawa…","t":9.76,"e":15.2,"w":[["Yeah",9.76,10.2],["Elengi",11.56,11.96],["ya",11.99,12.19],["bolingo",12.02,12.52],["ékómi",14.28,14.7],["mawa",14.76,15.2]],"ok":0.83},{"text":"Tala, bolingo na ngai ézali ndoto…","t":18.52,"e":22.38,"w":[["Tala",18.52,18.8],["bolingo",20.16,20.54],["na",20.6,20.7],["ngai",20.74,21.02],["ézali",21.06,21.52],["ndoto",21.54,22.38]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Listen.","t":35.26,"e":35.64,"w":[["Listen",35.26,35.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les draps sont froids,","t":54.7,"e":55.68,"w":[["Les",54.7,54.84],["draps",54.88,55.14],["sont",55.16,55.3],["froids",55.38,55.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le souvenir est un poison.","t":56.42,"e":58.4,"w":[["Le",56.42,56.5],["souvenir",56.6,57.28],["est",57.3,57.48],["un",57.54,57.66],["poison",57.72,58.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai perdu ton étoile,","t":59.38,"e":60.66,"w":[["J'ai",59.38,59.56],["perdu",59.62,59.98],["ton",60.06,60.26],["étoile",60.36,60.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai perdu ma raison.","t":60.68,"e":62.18,"w":[["J'ai",60.68,60.84],["perdu",60.92,61.28],["ma",61.36,61.5],["raison",61.58,62.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le décor est posé,","t":62.86,"e":64.04,"w":[["Le",62.86,62.98],["décor",63.06,63.48],["est",63.52,63.66],["posé",63.7,64.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais le rôle est trop grand.","t":64.14,"e":65.6,"w":[["Mais",64.14,64.28],["le",64.34,64.48],["rôle",64.54,64.76],["est",64.8,64.92],["trop",64.96,65.32],["grand",65.38,65.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je navigue seul,","t":65.86,"e":66.9,"w":[["Je",65.86,65.96],["navigue",66.06,66.46],["seul",66.58,66.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans cet océan de tourments.","t":66.96,"e":68.98,"w":[["Dans",66.96,67.12],["cet",67.2,67.46],["océan",67.5,68.14],["de",68.2,68.3],["tourments",68.42,68.98]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mo-te-ma na ngai é-za-li ko-tu-na, wa-pi yo?","t":69.26,"e":72.74,"w":[["Mo-te-ma",69.26,69.84],["na",69.88,69.96],["ngai",70.06,70.26],["é-za-li",70.32,70.88],["ko-tu-na",70.96,71.58],["wa-pi",71.64,72.4],["yo",72.54,72.74]],"ok":0.86},{"text":"Na ka-ti ya mwin-do, na zon-gi na mo-tam-bo-li ya mi-so.","t":72.68,"e":76.24,"w":[["Na",72.68,72.8],["ka-ti",72.88,73.24],["ya",73.27,73.47],["mwin-do",73.3,73.66],["na",73.74,73.88],["zon-gi",73.94,74.34],["na",74.38,74.52],["mo-tam-bo-li",74.58,75.18],["ya",75.34,75.54],["mi-so",75.5,76.24]],"ok":0.8},{"text":"Huuum Vanessa, Mama na Didi. Toujours entre deux avions. La mère des dossiers.","t":78.67,"e":85.74,"w":[["Huuum",78.67,78.87],["Vanessa",81.1,81.66],["Mama",82.68,82.92],["na",82.93,83.13],["Didi",82.94,83.32],["Toujours",83.42,83.74],["entre",83.78,84.04],["deux",84.1,84.26],["avions",84.32,84.62],["La",84.68,84.74],["mère",84.82,85.02],["des",85.06,85.18],["dossiers",85.22,85.74]],"ok":0.85},{"text":"Haaaaa Sanlé, monsieur des ondes ! En tout cas hier tu as dégagé les ondes même. Papa na ondulateur.","t":86.66,"e":93.88,"w":[["Haaaaa",86.66,86.86],["Sanlé",87.58,88.08],["monsieur",88.46,88.8],["des",88.84,89.06],["ondes",89.12,89.48],["En",89.84,89.94],["tout",90,90.12],["cas",90.16,90.32],["hier",90.38,90.6],["tu",90.7,90.76],["as",90.78,90.84],["dégagé",90.9,91.32],["les",91.38,91.58],["ondes",91.64,91.86],["même",91.98,92.18],["Papa",92.36,92.7],["na",92.72,92.92],["ondulateur",92.74,93.88]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Ba-ssa, na mo-te-ma...","t":96.48,"e":98.32,"w":[["Ba-ssa",96.48,97.28],["na",97.5,97.66],["mo-te-ma",97.72,98.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"O-za el-en-gi, o-za li-ta-ma.","t":98.6,"e":102,"w":[["O-za",98.6,98.8],["el-en-gi",98.88,100.08],["o-za",100.62,101.28],["li-ta-ma",101.38,102]],"ok":0.75},{"text":"Ba-ssa, na mo-te-ma...","t":103.3,"e":105.1,"w":[["Ba-ssa",103.3,104.14],["na",104.36,104.52],["mo-te-ma",104.58,105.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"O-zo ko-ti-a ngai, na mu-ku-ma.","t":105.19,"e":108.86,"w":[["O-zo",105.19,105.39],["ko-ti-a",105.28,106.48],["ngai",106.68,107.16],["na",107.76,107.94],["mu-ku-ma",108,108.86]],"ok":0.8},{"text":"Na le-la yo, lé-lé, lé-lé yo...","t":109.5,"e":111.62,"w":[["Na",109.5,109.66],["le-la",109.7,110.1],["yo",110.14,110.34],["lé-lé",110.58,110.96],["lé-lé",111,111.36],["yo",111.42,111.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Na le-la yo, lé-lé, lé-lé yo...","t":112.94,"e":115.06,"w":[["Na",112.94,113.1],["le-la",113.14,113.52],["yo",113.56,113.76],["lé-lé",114,114.38],["lé-lé",114.42,114.78],["yo",114.84,115.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Bolingo na ngai é-ko-mi, é-ko-mi, é-ko-mi...","t":115.5,"e":119.14,"w":[["Bolingo",115.5,116.08],["na",116.14,116.26],["ngai",116.3,116.62],["é-ko-mi",116.64,117.4],["é-ko-mi",117.7,118.26],["é-ko-mi",118.54,119.14]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Clas-sique !","t":119.98,"e":120.72,"w":[["Clas-sique",119.98,120.72]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Na le-la yo, lé-lé, lé-lé yo...","t":123.22,"e":125.34,"w":[["Na",123.22,123.38],["le-la",123.42,123.82],["yo",123.86,124.04],["lé-lé",124.28,124.68],["lé-lé",124.74,125.08],["yo",125.14,125.34]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Na le-la yo, lé-lé, lé-lé yo...","t":125.8,"e":128.76,"w":[["Na",125.8,125.96],["le-la",126,126.38],["yo",126.42,126.6],["lé-lé",127.72,128.08],["lé-lé",128.16,128.36],["yo",128.56,128.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"O-za mo-bi-m-ba, o-za ngai, o-za ngai...","t":129.24,"e":132.62,"w":[["O-za",129.24,129.62],["mo-bi-m-ba",129.84,130.68],["o-za",130.98,131.26],["ngai",131.32,131.74],["o-za",131.84,132.14],["ngai",132.18,132.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ma-gique !","t":133.72,"e":134.54,"w":[["Ma-gique",133.72,134.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"JO de JO, le vieux blanc baoulé, l’homme à la bonne humeur.","t":138.2,"e":142.9,"w":[["JO",138.2,138.34],["de",138.4,138.54],["JO",138.62,138.92],["le",139.54,139.64],["vieux",139.7,139.88],["blanc",139.96,140.18],["baoulé",140.22,140.68],["l’homme",141.62,141.88],["à",141.92,141.96],["la",142,142.08],["bonne",142.14,142.34],["humeur",142.36,142.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Madame Bony, c’est la famille.","t":144.62,"e":147.74,"w":[["Madame",144.62,145.02],["Bony",145.06,145.54],["c’est",146.72,146.86],["la",146.9,147],["famille",147.14,147.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Na lu-ka-ki yo na ka-ti ya ba rê-ves,","t":150.62,"e":153.28,"w":[["Na",150.62,150.78],["lu-ka-ki",150.82,151.2],["yo",151.44,151.64],["na",151.68,151.82],["ka-ti",151.88,152.28],["ya",152.3,152.5],["ba",152.32,152.5],["rê-ves",152.56,153.28]],"ok":0.75},{"text":"Mais réa-li-té é-za-li ma-ka-si, é-za-li ba grè-ves.","t":153.6,"e":156.9,"w":[["Mais",153.6,153.76],["réa-li-té",153.82,154.56],["é-za-li",154.64,155.04],["ma-ka-si",155.1,155.62],["é-za-li",155.64,156.1],["ba",156.12,156.32],["grè-ves",156.14,156.9]],"ok":0.86},{"text":"Les mots ne suffisent plus,","t":157,"e":158.5,"w":[["Les",157,157.2],["mots",157.24,157.42],["ne",157.46,157.58],["suffisent",157.64,158.16],["plus",158.24,158.5]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À combler ton absence.","t":158.8,"e":160.26,"w":[["À",158.8,158.88],["combler",158.94,159.32],["ton",159.4,159.6],["absence",159.64,160.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je m'efface doucement,","t":160.46,"e":161.9,"w":[["Je",160.46,160.6],["m'efface",160.66,161.12],["doucement",161.16,161.9]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dans cette triste silence.","t":162.18,"e":163.64,"w":[["Dans",162.18,162.3],["cette",162.43,162.63],["triste",162.56,162.94],["silence",163.02,163.64]],"ok":0.75},{"text":"O’ti-ke-li nga-i, ka-ka ma-wa ya pam-ba,","t":163.92,"e":166.8,"w":[["O’ti-ke-li",163.92,164.62],["nga-i",164.66,164.92],["ka-ka",165.16,165.52],["ma-wa",165.6,165.94],["ya",165.98,166.12],["pam-ba",166.22,166.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Nga na za-li ko le-la, ka-si o-za si-ka pam-ba.","t":166.96,"e":170.26,"w":[["Nga",166.96,167.16],["na",167.12,167.32],["za-li",167.44,167.88],["ko",167.91,168.11],["le-la",167.94,168.52],["ka-si",168.58,168.86],["o-za",168.88,169.16],["si-ka",169.22,169.58],["pam-ba",169.68,170.26]],"ok":0.78},{"text":"Marc Olivier, Ba migui migui, l’homme de la DFH.","t":172.0,"e":178.62,"w":[["Marc",172.0,172.2],["Olivier",173.74,174.68],["Ba",175.44,175.58],["migui",175.66,176.02],["migui",176.08,176.5],["l’homme",177.34,177.54],["de",177.58,177.64],["la",177.68,177.78],["DFH",177.84,178.62]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Haiii DIEKÈT, l’homme à la chaussure territoriale ! Vieux père, dis-nous où tu enlèves tes chaussures là même ?","t":180.44,"e":192.96,"w":[["Haiii",180.44,180.64],["DIEKÈT",182.26,183.22],["l’homme",184.88,185.18],["à",185.24,185.3],["la",185.36,185.48],["chaussure",185.54,186.14],["territoriale",186.22,187.38],["Vieux",188.82,189.04],["père",189.12,189.54],["dis-nous",190.4,190.82],["où",190.82,190.82],["tu",190.88,190.96],["enlèves",191,191.42],["tes",191.46,191.6],["chaussures",191.64,192.2],["là",192.23,192.43],["même",192.26,192.96]],"ok":0.88},{"text":"Le vieux LIKOU, l’homme qui a découvert l’embouchure des repos maladie. Tu es fort, vieux.","t":199.76,"e":206.6,"w":[["Le",199.76,199.84],["vieux",199.92,200.08],["LIKOU",200.12,200.46],["l’homme",201.64,201.94],["qui",202.02,202.1],["a",202.12,202.18],["découvert",202.24,202.8],["l’embouchure",202.82,203.52],["des",203.58,203.68],["repos",203.72,204.08],["maladie",204.14,204.74],["Tu",205.38,205.5],["es",205.54,205.66],["fort",205.82,206.2],["vieux",206.32,206.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"La mère Anne Marie, merci pour tout.","t":211.5,"e":215.34,"w":[["La",211.5,211.6],["mère",211.66,211.84],["Anne",211.86,212.06],["Marie",211.88,212.44],["merci",214.4,214.76],["pour",214.86,215.02],["tout",215.08,215.34]],"ok":0.86},{"text":"Merci aux alliés et à tous, c’est la famille.","t":217,"e":220.92,"w":[["Merci",217,217.38],["aux",217.4,217.6],["alliés",217.42,218.12],["et",218.18,218.18],["à",218.2,218.3],["tous",218.44,218.88],["c’est",220,220.14],["la",220.2,220.28],["famille",220.42,220.92]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Charles le Bon on The beat","t":221.62,"e":225.31,"w":[["Charles",221.62,222.2],["le",222.27,222.47],["Bon",222.34,222.58],["on",223.43,223.62],["The",224.27,224.47],["beat",225.12,225.31]],"ok":0.33},{"text":"Na le-la yo…","t":225.96,"e":226.82,"w":[["Na",225.96,226.12],["le-la",226.18,226.54],["yo",226.58,226.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Bolingo é-ko-mi ma-wa…","t":229.38,"e":232.14,"w":[["Bolingo",229.38,230],["é-ko-mi",230.1,231.16],["ma-wa",231.3,232.14]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"C’est fi-ni.","t":235.36,"e":236,"w":[["C’est",235.36,235.52],["fi-ni",235.62,236]],"ok":1.0}]}